## Interface: 120107, 120105, 50504, 40402, 30405, 20506, 16001, 11509
## Title: WoW API Lib
## Notes: Browse, search and export the WoW API from inside the game.
## Author: Tuubby
## Version: 0.1.0
## SavedVariables: WowApiLibDB
## Category: Development Tools
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Book_09

# Load order is the dependency graph. Namespace first because everything hangs
# off it. Docs and Runtime are the two data sources and read nothing from each
# other; Model joins them, Format turns entries into text, and Export and the
# browser only consume what those produce. Commands last, because every verb
# it registers calls into a file above it.

Core\Namespace.lua
Core\Docs.lua
Core\Runtime.lua
Core\Model.lua
Core\Format.lua
Core\Export.lua

UI\Widgets.lua
UI\Browser.lua
UI\Launchers.lua

Core\Commands.lua
